      "summary": "The Arizona College of Nursing-Ontario offers a comprehensive glossary of nursing terms as part of its Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSN) program. This glossary serves as a vital tool for nursing students to familiarize themselves with specialized terminology used in the nursing profession. By mastering these terms, individuals can enhance their communication skills and improve their professional performance, particularly in areas like acute and ambulatory care, advanced nursing roles, ethics, patient care, and medical tools and technology. The glossary includes detailed definitions of healthcare specialties, patient care processes, and the roles within nursing teams.",
